  "remarks": "Avangard Military Camp is a facility linked to the authorities of the Russian Federation which hosts Ukrainian minors transferred from occupied territories of Ukraine. These children are placed in environments where they are exposed to programmes aligned with Russian state policies, including political indoctrination and activities consistent with militarised and cadet-style education frameworks, such as military training and discipline.",
